===============================================================================
Tribute & Clean-Room Provenance Notice:
===============================================================================
SurShell is named in tribute to Dave Cutler's historic Windows NT 4.0 "SUR"
(Shell Update Release) milestone, which unified the modern desktop interface,
Taskbar, and Explorer with the rock-solid NT kernel.

All interfaces, data structures, and windowing abstractions in this repository
have been clean-room engineered in modern ISO C++23 strictly against publicly
available, openly licensed specifications:
  - Microsoft Win32 Metadata (MIT License): https://github.com/microsoft/win32metadata
  - Microsoft Open Specifications & Documentation (CC-BY 4.0 / MIT)

Windows, Windows NT, Win32, and DirectComposition are registered trademarks of
Microsoft Corporation. Nominative use of these marks is solely for
interoperability and architectural compatibility under fair use principles.
